/ Stage 10a: one name, one type. A plugin declaring a built-in's name fails loudly, as an error result.
/ IdentityShadow.dll declares "identity" (TestFixtures/IdentityShadow/Shadow.cs), copied next to this test.
Start
- code.load Path="IdentityShadow.dll", on error key "TypeLoadCollision" call Refused
- assert %refused% equals "TypeLoadCollision", "a second 'identity' is refused"
- assert %!app.type.identity.name% equals "identity", "the built-in identity still stands"

Refused
- set %refused% = %!error.Key%
